### ============================================
### RESTAURANT SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/medias
@id = 1
@referenceId = 1

### Create a media
### Request Body: MediaDto
### Response: Created MediaDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityType": 1,
  "entityId": 22,
  "url": "https://example.com/images/branch22.jpg",
  "altText": "Main entrance of Branch 22",
  "isPrimary": true,
  "mediaType": "image"
}

### Get a media by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: MediaDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all medias
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<MediaDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/reference/{referenceId}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update an existing media
### Request Body: MediaDto
### Response: Updated MediaDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete a media by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json